# Offline Gate A-D paths require no API keys or network services.
#
# `evitriage doctor --json` discovers Python, Java, and CodeQL from the process
# environment and PATH. Install optional tools outside this repository.
#
# DeepSeek V4 reads only the DEEPSEEK_API_KEY process environment variable.
# Do not put its value in this file. Use the documented hidden terminal prompt
# or an operating-system/cloud secret manager and unset it after the command.
